{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act9mini_level_act9mini_st05",
  "groupId": "act9mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "騎士之道",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9mini/level_act9mini_st05.txt",
  "sourceHash": "beded90cd184304ff49fd07d824c07b617af028f0071b3f9a0f844f08999f03d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔1.5-5"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "唔......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "叔叔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "決鬥中不要隨意和對手交流。我沒教過你嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "那麼，為什麼您不用法術？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "我倒是想先問問你，看你法術又有長進，那想必你已經意識到那個真相了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......關於這件事，是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "但是！瑪恩納叔叔，我並不希望您在這種時候——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "無需多言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "我的劍被你打落，那就是你贏了，瑪嘉烈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......即使......您從頭到尾都沒有使用法術嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "勝負就只是勝負，一切外因都是藉口，我什麼時候把你教育得這麼優柔寡斷了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "既然你已經意識到當年你的祖父為你的天真付出了什麼，你就更應該明白你回到這裡的意義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "瑪嘉烈，你在踐踏父親的意志。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "難道祖父的意志，就是教我們做一個懦夫嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "“不畏苦暗”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "是啊，不畏苦暗......你贏下了決鬥，你贏得了一個執迷不悟的機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "記得祈禱你的一意孤行，不會把太多的人捲進來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......叔叔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "您還是覺得，我們已經回不到那個時代了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "瑪嘉烈，你居然還能問出這樣的問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "稍後我有一場電話會議。特錦賽讓人們都很繁忙，至於你的奪冠遊戲......最好不要讓我分心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "正視現實吧，正視他人的生活。看看別人的柴米油鹽，別再因為你自己的榮耀就對他人抱有幻想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "你會失望的。遲早會的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "如果我沒有和您一樣呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......一樣？你嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "那看來流放的日子裡，你還是被你的那些薩卡茲朋友照顧得太好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姐姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姐姐，你沒事吧......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "嗯......我沒事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "好啦瑪莉婭，別抱這麼緊。這傢伙的手臂應該已經麻了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "啊！抱、抱歉......真的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "唉。不過我是真的沒想到，竟然會在今天看見你們兩個大打出手——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "——瑪恩納的劍，很沉吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "叔叔他這些年？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "普普通通，就過著普普通通的日子。早出晚歸的工作，永遠在忙著應付會議和客戶的刁難，偶爾因為“臨光”之名而受到爭議。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "不過這樣的“普普通通”，對他而言，恐怕和受刑也沒什麼差別吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "畢竟他以前是那麼的......唉，算了！不提啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "看看你眉頭皺的，贏了也沒什麼好心情，是吧？你們一家子都是這樣，總是一根筋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......但至少瑪恩納叔叔也同意姐姐參賽了，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "只要姐姐能再一次贏得冠軍，瑪恩納叔叔肯定也不會說什麼的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "畢竟這也是為了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "為了家族。為了自己。為了，騎士的榮耀。\n其實我明白，我明白在如今的騎士之國所得到的，大都與榮耀相去甚遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "瑪莉婭？怎麼突然不說話了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "肚子餓了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姑、姑母！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "不過現在，先讓瑪嘉烈休息一下吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......喂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "很抱歉，我剛回到家，在處理一些私事......沒關係，文件已經批註好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "特錦賽的廣告支援......？我嗎？不，您別拿我開玩笑了，我不擅長做這些......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......嗯。當然，這是工作，不該討價還價，抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "好的，我馬上就到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......窗戶開著，托蘭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "你身手退步了，我能感覺你的氣息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "但是下一次，麻煩你從正門進來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......好，沒受什麼傷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "叔叔手下留情了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "嗯......畢竟他連一丁點法術都沒用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "其實，我也很久沒見過瑪恩納那副表情......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "——好啦！起來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "接下來呢？你得去騎士協會那裡報到吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "會有一些繁瑣的流程，不過，現在還沒到那個時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姐姐......我們先前就那麼闖入了那場不了了之的比賽……真的沒問題嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "問題？這個人之前可還是個被流放的感染者哦？她可是直接砸爛了競技場的外牆衝進場內的哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "事到如今，干擾一兩場比賽已經根本無所謂了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "好、好像也是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "麻煩不會少的。當年也好，現在也罷，只要卡西米爾還是這副模樣，我們就會遭到各種阻撓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姐姐還是打算參加特錦賽？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "這是......姐姐一定要做的事情嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......瑪莉婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "不......只是，姐姐總算回家了，協會應該也不會為難叔叔和臨光家族......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "可如果姐姐再像幾年前一樣被聯合會盯上的話，我們——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......瑪莉婭說得不無道理，瑪嘉烈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "你還是那個耀騎士。無論騎士協會怎麼處理，無論監正會怎麼決定，你終究都是民眾和騎士們眼中的耀騎士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "我......我也不明白，瑪嘉烈，我不明白你堅持再一次參加特錦賽，到底在想些什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "你一定有自己的打算吧，雖然你們一家子的強脾氣一模一樣，但也不代表你真的那麼有勇無謀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......這只是一個開始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "即使在特錦賽上再一次獲得勝利......或是落敗，都只是一個開始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "瑪莉婭，佐菲婭姑母，如果所有人都怯懦地躲藏在一邊，對這個社會冷眼旁觀，用“無可奈何”來安慰自己——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "——那我們何時才能真正取回榮耀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "難道卡西米爾的騎士，一輩子，都只能在對過去時代的哀歎中自欺欺人嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......所以你想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "照亮大地的苦難，並不只是意味著我們要永無止境地去驅散黑暗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "有時候......有時候，只是為了照亮前路，只是為了給迷途中的他人，開闢新的視野。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "哪怕是如今的卡西米爾，堅持信仰，依舊是有意義的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姐姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......好吧，看來你倒是決心堅定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "不過，你才剛回卡西米爾就鬧出這麼一場好戲，有機會的話......瑪嘉烈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "別忘了，你回家了。這裡有你的家人，有你的回憶，有瑪莉婭......還有我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "至少，給瑪莉婭一個撒嬌的時間吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姑、姑母！你說什麼呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "這個孩子，這段時間，已經夠努力了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "也、也沒有......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "嗯。我知道，我以你為豪，瑪莉婭。你真的......真的長大了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "瑪莉婭·臨光，你會是一個優秀的騎士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "啊......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "關於這件事......姐姐。你想參加特錦賽的話，現在才開始積累積分，應該來不及吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "時間緊迫，但並不是毫無可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "是的......例如那位近幾年嶄露頭角的燭騎士，傳聞她積累積分，只花了一個月不到的時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "話雖如此，燭騎士是在預賽早期完成了積分儲備，就算瑪嘉烈能立刻得到騎士協會的認可，我們的時間也不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "你有什麼打算嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......賽制有一些改變，但不離其宗。只要能在混戰賽裡得到一次優勝，還是有機會的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "但是，這很冒險吧！？連我都會被騎士們特意針對，姐姐親自上陣的話，只會引來更厲害的對手......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "對。而且還不排除那些企業家們陷害你的可能性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "總之，這件事得儘快規劃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": ".......我、我有一個辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "瑪莉婭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "獨立騎士......我也好，姐姐也好，在沒有加入騎士團的情況下，是以“騎士家族”為單位參賽的，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......是這樣......比賽和註冊時的標誌，都是用臨光家族的紋章。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "而且，我記得，不光是“同一個騎士團”，“同一個騎士家族”之間的騎士，也是可以讓渡積分的，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "——瑪莉婭！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "不。我不能接受。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "瑪莉婭，這是你身為騎士奮戰的證明，我不能——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "——我不在乎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我......一開始選擇成為騎士，只是不希望我們的家，不再是那個家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "臨光家族的祖輩......爺爺，爸爸，還有姐姐。我不想失去這些東西，我想保護臨光家的榮耀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "但是......但是我意識到了，我還是把事情想得，太膚淺了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "如果我們按照他們的意思，去參賽，為了維護騎士之名而成為他們的騎士......那也......沒有真的改變什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姐姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......其實，我並不想成為騎士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "騎士改變不了騎士，姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "瑪莉婭......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "如果有些事情，只有姐姐才能做到，就請你去做吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我......只是想......讓這個家還是我們的家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "我明白了，瑪莉婭。但是，我還需要考慮一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......好啦，不要這麼沉重，辦法還有很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "一會要去老馬丁那裡喝一杯嗎？瑪嘉烈難得回來，那幾個老傢伙肯定也想和她多聊聊吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "叔叔那邊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......你們兩個就別去刺激他了。我會去看看情況的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "不過，瑪嘉烈，還有一件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "這座城市的感染者比以往都要多，而無胄盟也比任何時候都活躍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "小心些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "報到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "情況如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "......耀騎士與瑪恩納·臨光於剛才進行了一場決鬥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "從唇語判斷，應該是不歡而散。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "唉，真希望她就這麼老老實實待在家裡，和許久未見的家人團團圓圓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "千萬不要去摻和什麼奇怪的事情啊，耀騎士閣下，不然我們可就要勞心費神了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "......呃。白金閣下，所以我們.....？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "繼續監視。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "如果耀騎士有什麼動作......先通知我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......其他人在進行什麼任務？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "呃......根據規定......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "我不能知道，是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "算了，反正不是和感染者有關，就是和監正會有關吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "隨便吧，別輪到我們出場就好啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......瑪恩納。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "瑪恩納！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......有什麼事嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "你......還好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "最後那輪交鋒，瑪嘉烈雖然收手了，但你畢竟沒有穿盔甲......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "不勞費心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......出乎你的意料了，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "其實也出乎所有人的意料，她......變得比想像中要更......強大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......你只是來說這些的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "我是在關心你，瑪恩納。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "我淪落到要你來關心了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "是啊，你不會還沒有意識到吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......只是扭傷而已。她的劍法確實成長驚人，但是還沒到化解不了的地步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "不過......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "你想說，為什麼瑪嘉烈變成了這樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "當然，還有她的薩卡茲同伴，那些人......都是高尚的人，高尚到讓人敬畏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "這些年，她經歷的一切也許超過了你我的想像，瑪恩納。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "稍微......放下身段和她們聊一聊，不好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......你開始學會指手畫腳了，佐菲婭。教瑪莉婭成為騎士，就讓你這麼有成就感嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "在瑪嘉烈變得光彩奪目之前，你和她們的父親，你們兄弟二人曾是我們所有人心目中的英雄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "我知道你對我們的態度，馬丁也明白，老弗和科瓦爾都明白。但是，我對你也同樣......失望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "就這樣吧，祝你工作愉快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "......這裡，有人生活的痕跡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "是啊，他們的生活還殘留在這裡......可是，他們躲藏起來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "這已經是......我們見到的第三個聚落了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "在奢華的城市之中，感染者總是會逃進這些狹隘陰冷的角落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "很難想像，卡西米爾會對此無動於衷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "阿米婭和那位和藹的騎士婆婆，說的就是這些感染者嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "......是啊。連騎士們都知情。那麼事情一定不會這麼簡單。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "還有力氣嗎，夜鶯？也不早了，我們可以回去休息一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "不，我還能再堅持一會......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "那我們——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "呀——什麼動靜？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "施工隊......他們在拆除樓房......以及地下構造區的部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "......可如果有感染者還躲藏在地下的話......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "把今天見到的一切都記下吧，麗茲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "也許臨光她會瞭解些什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "耀騎士無言地行走在長廊上。\n榮耀像是路邊的籬笆，冠軍的掛像一路延綿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......瑪莉婭......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "唔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "......您、您是......耀騎士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "抱歉，這裡還沒有開放嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "啊，不......準確來說確實沒有對外開放，不過您算不算外人，我可說不準......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "好，麻煩您了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "呃......抱歉，我還沒做自我介紹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "請叫我馬克維茨吧，發言——是負責冠軍牆維護工作的員工。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "我能否冒昧地問一句，耀騎士閣下，您現在是什麼打算？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "耀騎士。其實直到今天，我才真正重獲這個封號。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "原來騎士協會已經認可......恭喜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "馬克維茨回過神來，他們向前望去，面前的正是耀騎士本人的掛像。\n儘管本尊就在身邊——正因為本尊就在身邊，馬克維茨突然產生了一種奇妙的預感。\n某些頑固的部分終於鬆動。某些一成不變的事情將在未來被打破。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "......您似乎比畫像裡更勇武幾分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "畢竟過去很多年了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "我知道您......您和騎士協會，和很多人都有矛盾。也許這不該我這樣的人插嘴，不過......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "我還是想對您說一句話。不是作為現在的我，呃，我是指，作為一名普通的騎士愛好者，一位大騎士領居民......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "請說，其實您大可不必這麼拘謹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "......歡迎回到卡西米爾，耀騎士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "我相信，這一切，才剛剛開始，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "啊，姐姐，你去哪了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......稍微在大騎士領逛了逛。叔叔呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我回來的時候，叔叔正好被叫去開會了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姐姐剛回來，確實應該去四處看看，感覺怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "似乎沒什麼變化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "是嗎？我可覺得這兩年的商城啊，速食店啊多了挺多來著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "但是這裡......好像冷清了很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "這些年賣掉了不少傢俱......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "叔叔有在企業工作，我也在科瓦爾師傅的工坊幫忙。其實，日常開銷完全沒有問題，叔叔也不讓我知道很多事情......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "但是老馬丁告訴過我，現在的臨光家，是很多騎士貴族和商人們的眼中釘，也許叔叔的壓力比我們想像的還要大吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "所以，姐姐......我們能和叔叔和好如初嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "很難，瑪莉婭，但我相信會的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "在我離開卡西米爾之前，其實和叔叔有過幾次爭吵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "那時佐菲婭姑母開導我，說是叔叔從我們父母失蹤的那天開始，變得對很多事情自暴自棄了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "可現在......我不能完全贊同姑母的看法，我......見過了很多人和事，事到如今，我再去面對瑪恩納叔叔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "還記得小時候爺爺和我們講的故事嗎？關於那個，叔叔第一次陪他遠遊，就收拾了的一個濫加賦稅，讓地方民不聊生的小貴族？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "記得。以前我們也沒法把那樣的青年和叔叔聯繫起來呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......未必是一些宏偉的事物才會改變人的意志，瑪莉婭。我見過許多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "叔叔他......也許從那時起，就開始失望了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "瑪莉婭，成為騎士，有什麼感想？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......其實，和我想像的不太一樣。姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......嗯，我能理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "所以我還是會參賽。哪怕，沒有人會理解這個決定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......姐姐......不，姐姐其實，是有支持者的吧？堅定的支持者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "我嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "閃靈姐姐和夜鶯姐姐呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "雖然只是一面之緣，但是看到各位站立在萬眾矚目的賽場上時的樣子，我能感受到那毫不猶豫地將後背託付給對方的信任感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姐姐，其實我早就想問了，這些年，你經歷了什麼呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......我遲早會說給你聽的，瑪莉婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "不過，這是一段很長很長的故事，也不會像以前給你念的騎士小說那樣，總能有一個團圓的結局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我們是姐妹嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲劫匪",
      "text": "搶啊！殺啊！把這些食物全部掠走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "騎士？卡西米爾的騎士為什麼會在這裡！？人都死光了，你們還裝模作樣要妨礙我們嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "......耀騎士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "騎士意味著......什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "不！臨光小姐！現在衝進風暴太危險了，得讓其他幹員——不，我和你一起去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "——浮士德。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "把她那張嘴給我打穿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "守林人",
      "text": "......騎士從沒幫過我們遊擊隊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "守林人",
      "text": "我的隊長和副隊長等了那麼多年，但等到最後，援軍也沒有來。只有我們自己戰鬥到最後一刻，戰鬥到被烏薩斯吞噬，只有幾個人活著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "解說",
      "text": "重回賽場的耀騎士！究竟打算給我們展現怎樣的風采！！難道本屆特錦賽，將創造一個數十年難遇的傳奇嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "解說",
      "text": "感染者還是騎士！？勝利還是敗北！？承載了多少夢想的刀刃，究竟是否還保有鋒芒！讓我們拭目以待！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "解說",
      "text": "有請——耀騎士——瑪嘉烈·臨光——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "長路至此，騎士回到了故鄉。\n一如既往的，耀騎士向前邁步。\n迎接她最大的挑戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
